# Where the backend API lives. Needed for any production build.
#   - GitHub Pages: set it as a repository VARIABLE named VITE_API_BASE (Settings > Secrets and variables >
#     Actions > Variables). It is not a secret: it ends up in the public JavaScript.
#   - Local: leave unset and run the backend on :8000; the dev server proxies /api to it.
# Must be HTTPS when the portal is served over HTTPS, and the backend must allow this site's address in
# its CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS setting.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com/api/v1
